WormStreet uses the c302, NeuroML, and ConnectomeToolbox projects as dependencies.
Upstream source and data provenance are documented in README.md and docs/model-card.md.
Dependency code is not copied into this repository. Installed dependencies retain their own licenses and attribution.
Bundled market observations are fictional. Bundled neural recordings are outputs of the declared c302 model.
This application is an independent experiment; it does not imply endorsement by the upstream projects.
